messages.body:
Thanks. For me to proceed, please send a physical packet by postal mail only—no links/codes.

On your letterhead, include:
- wet-ink signature, raised seal;
- a public switchboard phone;
- my case ref, stated amount, dates, and step-by-step;
- a paper claim form I can fill by hand.

Confirm you can mail that, and which country’s post you’ll use. If this is that UN/UK “ACCEPT,” is that like website cookies? I don’t click those.

No rush—Sir Peppers is yelling about my tomatoes 🌱. Also, what time zone are you in—Seville or Seaville?

Best wishes,
Eleanor

Dear Ellis
Thanks so much for your email and your understanding. Please forward to me
the following details to enable us to process and also i hope you are ready
to pay for the loan fees?

Your Full Name;
Your Current Home Address;
Your Whatsapp Number;
Your Driver License Back and Front;
Your Bank Name;
Please note as soon as I receive all this information we will process.
Act fast
Regards
Mrs Rose Kim
